Offline translation (English to Arabic)
---------------------------------------
Model: OPUS-MT eng-ara (Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-ar), by Jörg Tiedemann and
the Language Technology Research Group at the University of Helsinki.
Released under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/);
the Hugging Face model card lists Apache-2.0.
  - Source: https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-ar
  - Original weights: https://github.com/Helsinki-NLP/Tatoeba-Challenge/tree/master/models/eng-ara
  - Paper: Tiedemann and Thottingal, "OPUS-MT - Building open translation
    services for the World", EAMT 2020.
ONNX export and int8 quantization: Xenova (Transformers.js),
https://huggingface.co/Xenova/opus-mt-en-ar (commit 034a684356c1). OpenCircle
uses the files unmodified.

Text recognition (OCR)
----------------------
PaddleOCR PP-OCRv5 models (Apache-2.0), ONNX export by oar-ocr
(https://github.com/GreatV/oar-ocr, Apache-2.0).

